      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1948 and originally part of Buena Vista Township, Buena has deep historical roots, influenced by early land developer Charles K.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
