      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://buenaboro.gov/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "dropped_surname_no_wiki_source"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1999, Buena celebrated its 50th anniversary with the inaugural \"Buena Day\" at Bruno Melini Park, an event that continues to honor the borough’s growth and unity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://buenaboro.gov/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Padre Pio Shrine, established in 2002 in the Landisville section, attracts visitors seeking spiritual reflection.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://buenaboro.gov/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "It is also included in the greater Philadelphia‑Reading‑Camden metropolitan area, making it a welcoming and accessible place to live and visit.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
